      "title": "Putin takes hard line in US talks as Ukraine says Starlink disrupted again",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/12/vladimir-putin-russia-target-foreign-troops-ukraine-elon-musk-starlink",
      "description": "<p>Russian president says he would target any foreign troops sent to Ukraine and refuses to soften territorial demands</p><p>Vladimir Putin warned US negotiators that Russia would target any foreign troops deployed to Ukraine, in a series of hardline remarks that came as the Ukrainian military faced renewed disruptions to Elon Musk’s Starlink satellite service.</p><p>During the talks at the Kremlin with the US envoys Jared Kushner and Steve Witkoff on Thursday, the Russian president refused to soften his territorial demands, insisting on full control over four Ukrainian regions that Moscow claims to have annexed.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/12/vladimir-putin-russia-target-foreign-troops-ukraine-elon-musk-starlink\">Continue reading...</a>",
